---
source: crates/inset-cli/tests/lsp.rs
---
```inset
component Greeter
```

Greets visitors by name.

Holds `http: HttpServer`. Serves `GET /hello/{name}`.

----

```inset
http: HttpServer
```

A capability `Greeter` holds.

----

```inset
grant http: HttpServer { port };
```

A capability the app grants.

----

```inset
name: String
```

----

```inset
setting port: u16 = 8080;
```

The port to serve on.

A setting of the app.

----

```inset
#[get("/hello/{name}", via = http)]
fn hello(name: String) -> String
```

Replies with a greeting for the name in the path.

A route of `Greeter`, whose requests arrive through the grant `http`.

----

```inset
app HelloHttp
```

Hello HTTP: the smallest Inset program that serves the web.

Grants `http: HttpServer`.
